# SDD Refactor Skill

When activated for a refactor/optimization task:

1. Read `docs/for-agents/sdd-development-methodology.md`, section "ШАБЛОН 3" (Refactoring & Performance), and follow it literally.
2. Never change a public function signature that has callers in other modules{% if code_intelligence != "none" %} — verify via {{ code_intelligence }} impact analysis first{% endif %}.
3. Benchmark BEFORE: measure current latency distribution (min/median/p95/max) over 20 consecutive calls.
{%- if code_intelligence != "none" %}
4. Check all callers via {{ code_intelligence }}, then apply the optimization.
{%- else %}
4. Apply the optimization.
{%- endif %}
5. Benchmark AFTER: same measurement, produce a before/after comparison table.
{%- if test_command %}
6. Run `{{ test_command }}` to confirm no regression.
{%- endif %}
7. Final report must state: benchmark table{% if code_intelligence != "none" %}, impact-analysis output{% endif %}, and whether `bash bin/sdd_verify.sh` passed.
